  "note": "withWalletLock passes an opaque lane owner to its work, and withOwnedOrAcquiredLane and the effect history append reuse that live owner even outside its async frame; a foreign, wrong-lane or released owner refuses journal-fenced. Effect fence reuse also requires the acquiring async scope, and a failed unused-acquisition cleanup is kept and refuses later acquisitions. The eb/ dispatch history and native records each have their own record and byte budget. A history record may not carry seq. The commit recorded its change in the archive the package kept before the record files; this record states it in the record layout."
